WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:09.970
<i>Somewhere, neither in this life 
nor the afterlife, lies Kyoukai,</i>

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.640
<i>a border world between this and the next.</i>

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.450
<i>There, it is said, is a great "Rinne 
no Wa," the Ring of Reincarnation,</i>

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.990
<i>which channels the flow of life.</i>

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:26.040
So, within three days, someone will haunt 
you, curse you, and you will writhe in agony.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.240
You have only one way to avoid it:

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.010
go to the legendary weather 
box behind school,

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:35.260
ask it to protect you, 
and leave an offering.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.530
Bam!

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.520
A dream?

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.750
<i>I thought once I was in high school,</i>

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.170
<i>I'd grow up a little and slowly 
stop seeing strange things.</i>

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.170
<i>That was a weird dream.</i>

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.090
<i>And that place... 
the big red ring in the sky.</i>

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:42.090
<i>It was that world Rokudou-kun 
took me to the other day.</i>

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.100
Rokudou-kun, what exactly are you?

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:53.850
I guide restless spirits with 
earthly regrets to the Rinne no Wa.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.110
I'm a shinigami.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.110
A shinigami?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.110
Kind of thing.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:00.990
Kind of thing?

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.360
<i>So is he a shinigami?</i>

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.100
<i>Or is he not a shinigami?</i>

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.000
<i>Which is it?</i>

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Memories of the Red Ring

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.000
Hear me out!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.180
I had this horrible nightmare.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:19.010
This skull lady told me I'd 
be cursed in three days.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:21.780
Huh? I had that dream, too.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.060
I did, too.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:25.600
She said to make an offering 
to the legendary weather box.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.100
Me too, me too.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.020
I'm scared.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.520
<i>My classmates had the dream, too.</i>

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.550
Could it be...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.050
Here, the legendary weather box.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:43.390
Didn't they used to say 
that it grants your wishes?

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:46.410
So it might make sure we don't get cursed.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.640
Would bananas count as an offering?

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.430
Weird.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.040
It vanishes right as you put stuff in.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.070
I knew it. Rokudou-kun.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.440
Oy!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.530
Let go, Mamiya Sakura.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.050
I'm busy!

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.140
Sakura-chan.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:08.440
Sakura-chan, are you here 
to make an offering, too?

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.270
Rika-chan, Miho-chan, don't be fooled.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.090
Fooled?

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.360
Wait, did you see that?

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.420
She walked by us in a really weird posture.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:23.060
<i>Rokudou Rinne is invisible to normal people 
when he's wearing his Haori of the Underworld.</i>

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.410
<i>Handy.</i>

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.290
Just what are you talking 
about, Mamiya Sakura?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.470
Don't play dumb.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:36.290
You scared everyone in our dreams 
to make them pay offerings.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.220
That's a serious false accusation.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.920
I do what I need to do.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.910
My head feels heavy lately.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.880
Cold? Allergies?

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:50.110
I made a rice ball offering 
at the weather box.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.890
Do you think I should go to the hospital?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.890
You totally should.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.620
A sloth?

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:02.270
Dead from falling off a tree. 
But he — it — hasn't realized it.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.150
It must think that human is 
a tree it can hang off of.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:16.290
Spirit Duster

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.590
<i>This is a Spirit Duster.</i>

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.720
<i>It's used to dust away spirits 
clung to things or people.</i>

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.290
<i>On sale for 120 yen!</i>

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:27.470
Stop clinging and get on the 
Rinne no Wa immediately.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.080
But I think I'm okay now.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.610
I suddenly feel a lot better.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.600
Really? That's a relief.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.110
Yeah.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:49.090
I'm doing cleansings in 
exchange for the offerings.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.700
It's a legitimate trade.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.560
But people are really 
saying they had a dream.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.570
A dream?

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.480
Yeah, that there would be a curse 
if we don't make offerings,

00:05:58.480 --> 00:05:59.710
and that we'd be haunted and stuff.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.130
That's not me.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.350
Why would I need to do that?

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:07.340
But who else would do it 
besides you, Rokudou-kun?

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.190
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.350
<i>She's...</i>

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:18.960
Guess who!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:21.980
Grandma.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.230
Huh?

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:28.760
I told you to stop calling me that.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.240
Ow, ow!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.050
<i>She's the person that showed 
up in my dream this morning.</i>

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.620
<i>But I feel like I've seen her before.</i>

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.720
Stop it, my temples hurt.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:42.100
I came here because I was worried for you.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.000
Worried?

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.630
Rinne, you're having trouble 
getting by, aren't you?

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:50.350
Come live with me.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:51.750
I can't do that.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:52.760
Leave me alone.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.390
My only grandchild!

00:06:57.030 --> 00:07:02.040
<i>Grandchild? So she's really 
Rokudou-kun's grandma.</i>

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.270
She's so young.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.900
What? Say what?

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.050
Nothing.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.490
Did you say something just now?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.380
No, nothing.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.160
Yes, you did.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.540
Something that starts with a "y", ends 
with a "g", and has "oun" in between.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:20.370
Sorry, I just blurted it out 
because you seem so young.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.050
Oh my, my.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.550
Really?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.050
You can see me?!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.570
Mamiya Sakura is a little different.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.930
Anyway, was it you that scared my classmates 
in their dreams this morning, Grandma?

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:42.020
Stop calling me that.

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:45.380
Of course it was.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:48.070
I was hoping it'd help you out a little.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.960
I don't need your help.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:50.820
Oh?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.290
Well, then.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.400
My, this looks delicious.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.160
Wait.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.450
What are you doing with the offerings?

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.810
I'm confiscating it, of course.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:05.830
I scared them into leaving these. 
They're my spoils.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.090
Leave some, at least!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.790
Nah.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.020
Bye.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:11.720
Grandma!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.930
Wait, Rokudou-kun?

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:17.340
What are you doing, Mamiya Sakura?

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:18.650
Don't follow me.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:21.860
Haven't I told you that the 
living mustn't come here?

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.230
But I've been here before.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:29.570
What?

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:33.470
I don't know when, but before I met you.

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.150
A long time ago, just once.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.140
Seriously?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.570
What are you talking about?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.740
Rokudou-kun!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.870
Mamiya Sakura!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.420
She's not here.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.850
May I have one, then?

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.460
I thought I was going to die.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:16.240
But man, where am I?

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.620
How about a gift for the netherworld?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.290
Can I eat the rice crackers now?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.660
Of course.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.980
Have as many as you'd like.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.700
Kintsuba or Nerikiri, which should I have?

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:32.380
Have both. You don't need 
to hold back anymore.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.380
Buy now, and I'll make it cheap!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:39.640
You can even control it remotely 
for your family on the other side.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.810
It's like a festival,

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.180
though it's a bit weird.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:49.520
My, you don't see many as 
young as you here, young lady.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:56.160
It's an exorcism club. 
It'll quickly rid any evil spirit.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.930
It's on special offer for 19,800 yen.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.030
No, thanks.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.860
If you're on a tight budget, how about this?

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:09.360
An exorcism pot that might 
quickly contain an evil spirit.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.420
Only 2,800 yen.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.090
Um, I forgot my wallet in my classroom.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.420
I'll take that, then.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:20.390
No, this is Rokudou-kun's.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.010
It's not even yours, is it?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.520
Sorry, I don't need anything.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.150
Wait, young lady.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.060
Sorry.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.530
Nice to decease you

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:50.370
Nice to decease you

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.520
Are you saying, "come with me"?

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:57.130
Grandma, lend me a hand.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.760
Ow, ow, ow.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:06.810
Oh dear, you brought that 
girl over to this side?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.110
I didn't bring her.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.450
She followed me.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:10.560
We got lost.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.720
Oh, dear.

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:16.400
Let's have them look for her.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.080
It's kind of crowded.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.720
Do I get on?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.960
It's kind of nostalgic.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.530
It feels nice.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:22.420
Stupid! Stupid!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.930
This is bad.

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:26.810
Where is she?

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.520
Seems like she wandered into 
the Entry of Contentedness.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.060
Entry of Contentedness?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:37.710
Content!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:35.940
Yes, it's where those who 
finished life completely happy

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.320
and without regrets pass through.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.770
But Mamiya Sakura isn't dead yet.

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:42.820
Why is she there?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.270
I don't know, but for whatever 
reason, once you're there,

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:50.910
you end up feeling completely fulfilled, 
and you head straight to the Rinne no Wa.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.170
No, Mamiya Sakura.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.170
You'll die!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.910
That's the Rinne no Wa, isn't it?

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:15.690
It's like a red ferris wheel.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:21.440
Loading zone

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.530
Stand single file, please.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.840
Say, young lady.

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:24.900
Yes?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:29.280
You're quite young.
 Do you really have no regrets?

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:35.610
Yeah, we're content so 
it's okay with us, but...

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.900
Yeah, totally content.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.920
Very much. I can't wait for what comes next.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:43.510
Huh?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.250
<i>Come to think of it, 
it's all old people here.</i>

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.180
<i>They all look so fulfilled.</i>

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:52.410
But gee, you're so young, what a shame.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:55.600
Do you really not have any regrets?

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:58.600
<i>I kind of feel happy, too.</i>

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:02.480
Yes, I think I'm fine, now.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.970
<i>Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:08.000
That Sakura girl is going to get 
carried away by the contented mood

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.370
and go straight for the Rinne no Wa.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:18.420
Watch your step. Don't rush to get on.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.650
Have a nice next life.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.460
Thank you.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.270
Thanks for helping me, Bunny-san.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.770
<i>So these steps lead to the Rinne no Wa.</i>

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:38.250
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.770
<i>Does that mean I'm going to 
be reborn as something else?</i>

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:49.010
<i>Oh, no wonder. That's why they were 
asking if I really had no regrets.</i>

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:52.300
I don't!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.950
<i>Right now, Mamiya Sakura is being 
carried away by the contented mood</i>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.290
<i>of the people around her.</i>

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.340
Wait, Mamiya Sakura!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.250
Hey!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.650
That voice.

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:11.090
It sounded like Rokudou-kun.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.720
The sleeve from his haori.

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:21.850
The really-precious haori that the 
really-poor Rokudou-kun cherished so much.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.360
I feel bad bringing it with me.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.020
I wish I could have given it back.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.030
Mamiya Sakura!

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.180
Rokudou-kun.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.040
Do you have any idea?

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.050
You were about to die!

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.230
<i>He came to save me.</i>

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:53.890
Tha—

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.790
Bunny-san?

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.050
If only I had a sickle, he'd be nothing.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.270
Spirit Pepper!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:50.070
Spirit Pepper

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:44.060
<i>This is a shinigami tool, Spirit Pepper.</i>

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.920
<i>Be exposed to this, and you'll 
sneeze so much it hurts.</i>

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.070
<i>You could also just use regular pepper.</i>

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.620
Time for the big guns.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:23.770
Spirit Cracker

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.380
<i>This is a Spirit Cracker.</i>

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.450
<i>A shinigami tool to fight off 
enemies with a loud sound.</i>

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.770
<i>A regular cracker can also have the same effect.</i>

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.290
<i>I remember now.</i>

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.780
<i>That day I went to my grandma's 
place in the countryside.</i>

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.700
<i>It was standing there in the entrance 
to the path on the hill by her house.</i>

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.700
It's a bunny!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.780
<i>The bunny took me to...</i>

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:52.840
A festival!

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:00.220
Cool!

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:06.950
Weird!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.960
Bunny-san.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:23.620
Bunny-san?

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:29.110
A little girl like yourself mustn't come here.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:34.500
Break Area

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:34.500
It cost me 348 yen to save you.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.980
It was your fault for bringing 
her here in the first place.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.630
Hey, don't eat my offerings.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.010
Um, I remember now.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.020
I've came here once when I was a kid.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:54.310
I was invited here by that bunny.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:55.300
Bunny?

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:58.300
Yes, it was wearing a weird t-shirt.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:18:59.900
It called me over.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.530
That's a <i>damashigami</i>

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.780
A damashigami?

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:07.140
It's written like this.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.660
Whoa, that's a lot of strokes.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:16.040
Damashigami trick living humans onto the 
Rinne no Wa in order to meet their quota.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:19.670
They're a shady kind of shinigami.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:34.390
So you made it home to your 
own world when you were a kid.

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:37.280
Yes. Someone helped me back.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.930
I can't remember, for some reason.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:46.010
She had bright white hair, and 
she was wearing a black kimono.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:49.790
I think she had a red flower hairpiece.

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:54.080
Oh, and she was wearing the 
same haori as Rokudou-kun.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.130
She was a really kind old lady.

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:04.630
Are you sure it wasn't a young lady?

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:07.140
My temples, ow, ow...

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.730
You're that old lady?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.210
Young lady.

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:15.020
Tell me, please, young lady.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:18.480
Oh my, ask me anything.

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:22.360
Ever since then, 
I've been able to see spirits.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.430
I've gotten used to it now,

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:33.060
but it's been bothering me because 
I didn't know what was causing it.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:37.500
Is it because I came to a world 
that I wasn't supposed to come to?

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.750
That can't be it.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.170
You wouldn't become able 
to see spirits unless

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.340
you ate or drank something from this world.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:46.340
Huh? I did.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.800
I want that candy.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.390
All right, I'll buy you one.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:51.850
Yay!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.690
I might have done that.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.020
Sorry for the trouble.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:21:00.230
No, I feel better now 
that I know what it was.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.620
Rinne, are you leaving after all?

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:14.370
Like I said, I can't live on this side.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.060
Oh.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.760
Hey, Rokudou-kun.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:25.810
What?

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:31.140
Why don't you live with your grandma?

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.930
That's Sakura-chan and Rokudou-kun, isn't it?

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:37.520
Huh? Since when were they so close?

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:40.020
Because Grandma is a shinigami.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:41.070
Huh?

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:45.530
Not a damashigami, of course. 
A legitimate shinigami.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:49.530
But you're a shinigami, too, aren't you?

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:51.410
I'm a human.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:53.460
Human?

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:55.850
Kind of thing.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:59.420
Huh? What does that mean?

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.040
Imagine if they're already 
dating without us knowing.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:09.350
Nah, we don't know that yet.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:11.600
Let's just watch over them quietly for now.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.530
You're right.

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:13.930
We're friends, after all.

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:16.760
Oh, what should we do 
about Sakura-chan's bag?

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:18.330
Tomorrow's fine, isn't it?

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:19.690
Yeah.

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:25.190
Next Episode
Freak of the Club Building

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.560
Hey, Rokudou-kun.

00:24:02.560 --> 00:24:04.980
If you have a request, leave 
a letter in the weather box.

00:24:04.980 --> 00:24:05.250
Huh?

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:07.250
Don't forget your money and offerings.

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:08.640
Uh...

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:09.380
Preferably something non-perishable.

00:24:09.780 --> 00:24:10.980
I don't have a fridge.

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:11.700
But—

00:24:11.700 --> 00:24:12.840
I can't take rice, either.

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.010
I don't have a rice cooker.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:15.010
Oh.

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.260
Fine, then.

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:19.310
I had some candy left over, 
so I thought you might want it.

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:20.280
What?

00:24:20.280 --> 00:24:24.170
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"Freak of the Club Building."

00:24:24.170 --> 00:24:26.470
Can I have some? Please!
